(5686530, 827590, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite so sure I would say this is into or out of the frame in the sense that the challenge stipulates, but I think this is an excellent image. Your choice of dof is great, and the look on the child''s face along with the figure in the background are exceptional. I really enjoy the varied lighting on the high grasses as well- it really adds depth and interest to an otherwise monotone element. I didn''t vote, but would''ve voted this highly.</td>', 'I''m not quite so sure I would say this is into or out of the frame in the sense that the challenge stipulates, but I think this is an excellent image. Your choice of dof is great, and the look on the child''s face along with the figure in the background are exceptional. I really enjoy the varied lighting on the high grasses as well- it really adds depth and interest to an otherwise monotone element. I didn''t vote, but would''ve voted this highly.', '2009-10-14 05:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
