(5689162, 827528, 108525, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  It doesn''t seem like she is moving in or out of the frame though????</td>', 'Great shot!  It doesn''t seem like she is moving in or out of the frame though????', '2009-10-16 00:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689163, 827688, 108525, '<td valign="top">It seems as though you visited the same locale as another entrant.</td>', 'It seems as though you visited the same locale as another entrant.', '2009-10-16 00:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689164, 827581, 108525, '<td valign="top">If the geese are your intended subject, you may want to include them a bit better into the photo.  I look at this photo and say  "it''s a photo of a bridge"  The geese are barely bigger than a dust speck on the lens.</td>', 'If the geese are your intended subject, you may want to include them a bit better into the photo.  I look at this photo and say  "it''s a photo of a bridge"  The geese are barely bigger than a dust speck on the lens.', '2009-10-16 00:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689166, 827531, 108525, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of perspective.</td>', 'Interesting choice of perspective.', '2009-10-16 00:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689167, 826899, 108525, '<td valign="top">He doesn''t seem to be moving into or out of the frame</td>', 'He doesn''t seem to be moving into or out of the frame', '2009-10-16 00:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689169, 826777, 108525, '<td valign="top">He doesn''t seem to be moving into or out of the frame.  It seems more like a portrait.</td>', 'He doesn''t seem to be moving into or out of the frame.  It seems more like a portrait.', '2009-10-16 00:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689173, 826957, 108525, '<td valign="top">I think the shot needed to be just a hair quicker to capture a bit more detail in the passing runners.</td>', 'I think the shot needed to be just a hair quicker to capture a bit more detail in the passing runners.', '2009-10-16 00:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689176, 827664, 108525, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh!</td>', 'This made me laugh!', '2009-10-16 00:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689178, 827590, 108525, '<td valign="top">They don''t seem to be moving into or out of the frame</td>', 'They don''t seem to be moving into or out of the frame', '2009-10-16 00:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689180, 827657, 108525, '<td valign="top">He doesn''t seem to be moving into or out of the frame.  He appears to just be stationary<br/>"Create an image where the subject(s) is/are <b>moving</b> into or out of the frame."<br/> <br/>Beautiful picture though!</td>', 'He doesn''t seem to be moving into or out of the frame.  He appears to just be stationary"Create an image where the subject(s) is/are moving into or out of the frame." Beautiful picture though!', '2009-10-16 00:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689181, 827432, 108525, '<td valign="top">Nothing seems to be moving into or out of the frame.  <br/> <br/>"Create an image where the subject(s) is/are <b>moving</b> into or out of the frame. The subject(s) need not be human but must be <b>able to move </b>on its/their own."</td>', 'Nothing seems to be moving into or out of the frame.   "Create an image where the subject(s) is/are moving into or out of the frame. The subject(s) need not be human but must be able to move on its/their own."', '2009-10-16 00:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689182, 827307, 28882, '<td valign="top">just passing through, i can feel it.</td>', 'just passing through, i can feel it.', '2009-10-16 00:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689183, 827043, 28882, '<td valign="top">very nice panning. love the wheel.</td>', 'very nice panning. love the wheel.', '2009-10-16 00:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689184, 827427, 28882, '<td valign="top">pretty graphic one.  kinda freaky</td>', 'pretty graphic one.  kinda freaky', '2009-10-16 00:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689185, 826637, 108525, '<td valign="top">Maybe use a fill flash on the subject to bring in more attention.  The Subject, the bike/rider, just blends in with the graffiti</td>', 'Maybe use a fill flash on the subject to bring in more attention.  The Subject, the bike/rider, just blends in with the graffiti', '2009-10-16 00:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689186, 827627, 28882, '<td valign="top">pretty intense cloud cover.</td>', 'pretty intense cloud cover.', '2009-10-16 00:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689187, 827549, 28882, '<td valign="top">nice colors.  the water has a calm feel to it.   the loose feathers are nice too.</td>', 'nice colors.  the water has a calm feel to it.   the loose feathers are nice too.', '2009-10-16 00:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689188, 827532, 108525, '<td valign="top">"Create an image where the subject(s) is/are <b>moving</b> into or out of the frame. The subject(s) need not be human but must be able to move on its/their own."</td>', '"Create an image where the subject(s) is/are moving into or out of the frame. The subject(s) need not be human but must be able to move on its/their own."', '2009-10-16 00:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689189, 827705, 28882, '<td valign="top">my eye followed to the focused area and the ant.  nice effect.</td>', 'my eye followed to the focused area and the ant.  nice effect.', '2009-10-16 00:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689190, 826974, 108525, '<td valign="top">"Create an image where the subject(s) is/are <b>moving</b> into or out of the frame. The subject(s) need not be human but must be able to move on its/their own."</td>', '"Create an image where the subject(s) is/are moving into or out of the frame. The subject(s) need not be human but must be able to move on its/their own."', '2009-10-16 00:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689193, 826777, 28882, '<td valign="top">doesn''t feel like it''s going in or out but it''s very cute though.</td>', 'doesn''t feel like it''s going in or out but it''s very cute though.', '2009-10-16 00:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689194, 827544, 28882, '<td valign="top">nice entry.  a bit dim though.</td>', 'nice entry.  a bit dim though.', '2009-10-16 00:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689196, 826957, 28882, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great shot, but then i love this kind of thing.  (i got nailed hard though for using blur, i hope you fair better.)</td>', 'I think this is a great shot, but then i love this kind of thing.  (i got nailed hard though for using blur, i hope you fair better.)', '2009-10-16 00:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5689197, 827544, 108525, '<td valign="top">I think i''m to assume that the dark blobs in the background are the intended subject to be moving into/ out of the frame.  It''s a bit of a stretch of the imagination to invision surfboards on their shoulders.  Perhaps a deeper DoF was needed to properly include the intended subjects into the composition.<br/>I''m not trying to be mean or cruel, just trying to give an honest opinion of what I see.</td>', 'I think i''m to assume that the dark blobs in the background are the intended subject to be moving into/ out of the frame.  It''s a bit of a stretch of the imagination to invision surfboards on their shoulders.  Perhaps a deeper DoF was needed to properly include the intended subjects into the composition.I''m not trying to be mean or cruel, just trying to give an honest opinion of what I see.', '2009-10-16 00:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
