(5690142, 827313, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s a great shot, I would have scored it higher if you had caught it just entering or just leaving the frame. It''s pretty close to being in the middle. 6</td>', 'It''s a great shot, I would have scored it higher if you had caught it just entering or just leaving the frame. It''s pretty close to being in the middle. 6', '2009-10-17 00:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5690147, 827528, 103142, '<td valign="top">cute picture, but she''s just sitting. She''s neither entering or leaving the frame. You might have meant that the hands or the pop is leaving the frame, but that seems a stretch, imo. Sorry...</td>', 'cute picture, but she''s just sitting. She''s neither entering or leaving the frame. You might have meant that the hands or the pop is leaving the frame, but that seems a stretch, imo. Sorry...', '2009-10-17 00:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5690152, 827532, 103142, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to do with this one... It''s a wonderful shot. I really like it. But I just can''t see it meeting the challenge. The subject is supposed to be moving in or out of the frame. Yes, the tree continues past the frame, but the tree isn''t moving out of the frame (or into it). The tree is just sitting there. I''m sorry.</td>', 'I don''t know what to do with this one... It''s a wonderful shot. I really like it. But I just can''t see it meeting the challenge. The subject is supposed to be moving in or out of the frame. Yes, the tree continues past the frame, but the tree isn''t moving out of the frame (or into it). The tree is just sitting there. I''m sorry.', '2009-10-17 00:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
