(5692522, 827528, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a great image of the baby enjoying a frosty A&amp;W Root Beer. I think the key to the challenge was to create a dynamic image which would involve movement. This image is more static. Also the subject seems to be centered in the frame and doesn''t appear to be entering or leaving the frame.</td>', 'This is a great image of the baby enjoying a frosty A&W Root Beer. I think the key to the challenge was to create a dynamic image which would involve movement. This image is more static. Also the subject seems to be centered in the frame and doesn''t appear to be entering or leaving the frame.', '2009-10-19 17:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
