(5693214, 827590, 67152, '<td valign="top">Come on you crazy Aussie woman! How the heck does this fit the challenge???????!!!! <br/> <br/>1. The warrior here is completely on screen and centered as is the child warrior (good composition - so it doesn''t meet requirements of the challenge). <br/>2. Both of these are human (so although it meets the challenge description - if I read it incorrectly - and I choose to read it incorrectly like a lot of people on DPC - it doesn''t meet challenge). <br/>3. The warrior in back is coming into the scene from behind - not up, not down, not sideways, not upside down, not from above, not from below, not on a string, not on a kite, not with a pole vault, and not on a motorbike, and these are the only ways I could think of, so I must conclude definitively that he is not actually moving, even though I have already stated that he is moving...So it therefore DNMC!!!!! <br/>4. The image is way to small at 640px.  This shot should be at 800px!<br/> <br/>So, therefore I must give you a 1....<br/>.<br/>.<br/>.<br/>.<br/>.<br/>.<br/>.<br/>.<br/>Hehe - that was fun as well!  (Someone you know got a very similar comment)  <br/> <br/> <br/>Of course, I guessed who''s shot this is  (or rather figured that two shots with similar subjects and the landscape were likely taken by)...<br/> <br/>This is actually an awesome shot - one of my favorites in the whole challenge - but I am really not voting on this challenge but figured I would give some comments to my favs..</td>', 'Come on you crazy Aussie woman! How the heck does this fit the challenge???????!!!!  1. The warrior here is completely on screen and centered as is the child warrior (good composition - so it doesn''t meet requirements of the challenge). 2. Both of these are human (so although it meets the challenge description - if I read it incorrectly - and I choose to read it incorrectly like a lot of people on DPC - it doesn''t meet challenge). 3. The warrior in back is coming into the scene from behind - not up, not down, not sideways, not upside down, not from above, not from below, not on a string, not on a kite, not with a pole vault, and not on a motorbike, and these are the only ways I could think of, so I must conclude definitively that he is not actually moving, even though I have already stated that he is moving...So it therefore DNMC!!!!! 4. The image is way to small at 640px.  This shot should be at 800px! So, therefore I must give you a 1............Hehe - that was fun as well!  (Someone you know got a very similar comment)    Of course, I guessed who''s shot this is  (or rather figured that two shots with similar subjects and the landscape were likely taken by)... This is actually an awesome shot - one of my favorites in the whole challenge - but I am really not voting on this challenge but figured I would give some comments to my favs..', '2009-10-20 06:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
