(5693220, 827584, 67152, '<td valign="top">Come on!  How does this fit the challenge???????!!!!<br/> <br/>1.  The warrior here is completely on screen (good composition - so it doesn''t meet requirements of the challenge).<br/>2.  He is human (so although it meets the challenge description - if I read it incorrectly - it doesn''t meet challenge).<br/>3.  I can''t quite figure out whether he came from below, above, the left or the right...so I am going to assume he was not moving during this shot<br/>4.  The image seems a bit small at 640px - Why didn''t you post it at 800px?<br/> <br/>so I think I will have to give you a 1....<br/> <br/>hehe - that was fun...!<br/> <br/>Great shot - love the energy, love the color and intensity of his face (I just wish we could see it better - come on 800pixels!), and think this one is right on the money.   No vote for me....</td>', 'Come on!  How does this fit the challenge???????!!!! 1.  The warrior here is completely on screen (good composition - so it doesn''t meet requirements of the challenge).2.  He is human (so although it meets the challenge description - if I read it incorrectly - it doesn''t meet challenge).3.  I can''t quite figure out whether he came from below, above, the left or the right...so I am going to assume he was not moving during this shot4.  The image seems a bit small at 640px - Why didn''t you post it at 800px? so I think I will have to give you a 1.... hehe - that was fun...! Great shot - love the energy, love the color and intensity of his face (I just wish we could see it better - come on 800pixels!), and think this one is right on the money.   No vote for me....', '2009-10-20 06:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
