(5693358, 827584, 106806, '<td valign="top">hmmm... I guess it all depends on what he does with that spear when he lands. What I don''t understand is how you got so much movement into the chap, no motion blure or nuffin ... it looks like he should be looking like he''s just hanging in the air but I can really feel and see that jump.</td>', 'hmmm... I guess it all depends on what he does with that spear when he lands. What I don''t understand is how you got so much movement into the chap, no motion blure or nuffin ... it looks like he should be looking like he''s just hanging in the air but I can really feel and see that jump.', '2009-10-20 09:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
