(5693360, 827596, 106806, '<td valign="top">sky is bit screwed though tht rest of the shot is just superb. I bet if advanced editing was allowed you could fix that sky.</td>', 'sky is bit screwed though tht rest of the shot is just superb. I bet if advanced editing was allowed you could fix that sky.', '2009-10-20 10:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5693373, 827482, 103916, '<td valign="top">From my understanding the object is supposed to be able to move on its own.  I understand what your message was trying to get across.  I have to complained about others not understanding the perspective of the photographer and such.  I do also feel that our photographs do represent each of us in some way.  I will definetly keep that in mind as I vote and comment in the future challanges.  I appreciate your time in writing the message you sent to me earlier.  I apologize if I offended you in any way.  Have a great day!</td>', 'From my understanding the object is supposed to be able to move on its own.  I understand what your message was trying to get across.  I have to complained about others not understanding the perspective of the photographer and such.  I do also feel that our photographs do represent each of us in some way.  I will definetly keep that in mind as I vote and comment in the future challanges.  I appreciate your time in writing the message you sent to me earlier.  I apologize if I offended you in any way.  Have a great day!', '2009-10-20 10:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
