(5693671, 826922, 67258, '<td valign="top">I would hazard a guess at Cutout - if I am wrong, consider it a compliment.  A really pleasing image - strong graphically, meets the challenge, and keeps my attention.</td>', 'I would hazard a guess at Cutout - if I am wrong, consider it a compliment.  A really pleasing image - strong graphically, meets the challenge, and keeps my attention.', '2009-10-20 16:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
