(5693729, 826899, 108580, '<td valign="top">I''m almost convinced the wasp (?) is long dead and has lost its normal vibrant colour. If it is dead, then the DOF could have been way better. His top right antennae is broken off and theres lots of dust on eyes and body as well as a broken left (his left) mandible. If I''m wrong, PM me? Sorry!</td>', 'I''m almost convinced the wasp (?) is long dead and has lost its normal vibrant colour. If it is dead, then the DOF could have been way better. His top right antennae is broken off and theres lots of dust on eyes and body as well as a broken left (his left) mandible. If I''m wrong, PM me? Sorry!', '2009-10-20 18:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5693731, 827465, 108580, '<td valign="top">It took me while to get this shot, ceiling fan, slow shutter, a bit of noise.<br/>After looking at it a third time I appreciated it more and bumped 2 more points.</td>', 'It took me while to get this shot, ceiling fan, slow shutter, a bit of noise.After looking at it a third time I appreciated it more and bumped 2 more points.', '2009-10-20 18:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5693735, 827602, 108580, '<td valign="top">Odd Peacock. Albino? There were a few things I didnt like, sorry, but the DOF was out, the branch cutting its head off is distracting as is the background bokeh. The exposure however is good, as the bird is almost entirely in its own shade and the feathers arent blown.</td>', 'Odd Peacock. Albino? There were a few things I didnt like, sorry, but the DOF was out, the branch cutting its head off is distracting as is the background bokeh. The exposure however is good, as the bird is almost entirely in its own shade and the feathers arent blown.', '2009-10-20 18:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5693742, 827667, 108580, '<td valign="top">The camera shake really destroyed my 1st opinion of your shot. Perhaps emphasised by a severe crop? Had the nest been in focus, then the OOF bird would have drawn my attention more and it would have scored higher.</td>', 'The camera shake really destroyed my 1st opinion of your shot. Perhaps emphasised by a severe crop? Had the nest been in focus, then the OOF bird would have drawn my attention more and it would have scored higher.', '2009-10-20 18:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5693744, 827618, 108580, '<td valign="top">I would have rated this higher if the background fence and building didn''t destroy it.</td>', 'I would have rated this higher if the background fence and building didn''t destroy it.', '2009-10-20 18:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5693751, 827394, 99506, '<td valign="top">I love the use of sepia and grain here, it give a nice authentic feel.</td>', 'I love the use of sepia and grain here, it give a nice authentic feel.', '2009-10-20 18:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5693752, 827586, 99506, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot that meets the challenge and is well executed. Nice work 8</td>', 'Beautiful shot that meets the challenge and is well executed. Nice work 8', '2009-10-20 18:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
