(5693985, 826661, 88580, '<td valign="top">Love how everything fits into the frame with nearly perfect alignment.  Nice contrast between the cool colors of the scene and the brightly colored umbrella.  Just the right amount of motion blur.  Cool door; cool architecture in general.</td>', 'Love how everything fits into the frame with nearly perfect alignment.  Nice contrast between the cool colors of the scene and the brightly colored umbrella.  Just the right amount of motion blur.  Cool door; cool architecture in general.', '2009-10-20 23:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
