(5694136, 827562, 54645, '<td valign="top">By the way Hopper is a wolf not sad little insect! ;) Great finish Lydia, congrats!<br/> <br/>"Out of the night Hopper came, and Perrin was one with the wolf. Hopper, the cub who had watched the eagles soar, and so badly wanted to fly through the skies as the eagles did. The cub who hopped and jumped and leaped until he could leap higher than any other wolf, and who never lost the cub''s yearning to soar through the sky. Out of the night Hopper came and left the ground in a leap, soaring like the eagles."</td>', 'By the way Hopper is a wolf not sad little insect! ;) Great finish Lydia, congrats! "Out of the night Hopper came, and Perrin was one with the wolf. Hopper, the cub who had watched the eagles soar, and so badly wanted to fly through the skies as the eagles did. The cub who hopped and jumped and leaped until he could leap higher than any other wolf, and who never lost the cub''s yearning to soar through the sky. Out of the night Hopper came and left the ground in a leap, soaring like the eagles."', '2009-10-21 01:12:40.000000', NULL, 0),
